OL,3,GNEWSAHuntingdon train attacker found
OL,4,Aguilty of seven counts of attempted
OL,5,Amurder
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthony Williams - who stabbed
OL,8,Fpassengers on a train between
OL,9,FPeterborough and London in 2025 - has
OL,10,Fbeen found guilty of seven counts of
OL,11,Fattempted murder
OL,13,FWilliams, 33, stabbed 10 people on an
OL,14,FLNER service on 1 November last year
OL,16,FIn total, he denied 14 counts of
OL,17,Fattempted murder, including alleged
OL,18,Fattacks away from the train, in
OL,19,FPeterborough and London
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
